  "data": {
    "summary": "[LETHAL HITS] counts only when this attack targets a unit with neither MONSTER nor VEHICLE. If even one model in the target unit has either keyword, the whole unit counts as having it, so the ability does nothing. Otherwise, on a critical hit you may declare that the attack wounds without a wound roll. Skipping that roll means the attack can never become a critical wound, so it cannot set off effects like [DEVASTATING WOUNDS]; you are free to roll normally instead.",
